# Contributing Guidelines

Contributions to this project are welcome!

All contributions, including bug reports, bug fixes, documentation improvements, enhancements, and ideas, are welcome.

## How to Contribute

1. Fork the repository.
2. Create a branch for your changes.
3. Make your changes and test them.
4. Commit your changes with a descriptive commit message.
5. Submit a pull request describing your contribution.

## Reporting Bugs

When reporting a bug, include a clear description of the issue, the steps to reproduce it, and the expected behavior.

## Documentation and Improvements

Documentation improvements, feature enhancements, and suggestions for new ideas are encouraged.

Thank you for helping improve this project!
